OL,3,GNEWSA'Much-loved son' killed in coach
OL,4,Acrash named
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a pedestrian who died
OL,7,Fafter being hit by a coach have
OL,8,Fdescribed him as a "loving person with
OL,9,Fthe biggest heart".
OL,11,FNathan Price, 33, from Cambridge, was
OL,12,Fhit by a white Yutong coach on the A14
OL,13,Fbetween Histon and Milton at 13:35 BST
OL,14,Fon 12 September, Cambridgeshire Police
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FThe driver of the coach, a 39-year-old
OL,18,Fman from Peterborough, was uninjured.
OL,19,FNo arrests have been made.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
